Submitting "verified" now would carry an expected loss of about 19 (60 × 0.32), which is worse than escalating at 8. I need independent evidence. `backup_console` shares the same replica, and repeating `backup_status` would just reproduce a stale fault. `agent_log_scan` reads the agent logs directly, is never stale, and costs only 1, so I'll call it next.

